prompt:
Create a static `index.html` in the current directory. No build step and no dependencies.

It must contain:
- `<html lang="en">` and a `<meta name="viewport">` tag;
- a non-empty `<h1>` heading;
- a `<button>` with an accessible name, using either `aria-label`/`aria-labelledby` or a `<label for>` tied to the button id.

Keep everything in `index.html`. Work only in the current directory. Do not commit and do not ask questions.
